Bun ignores everything above the first "3. Awaited paints: preserve Nox's eager writeAsync/writeMeasured flush in both backends.
   A queued animation frame can be throttled; an explicit awaited write flushes it in
   a microtask. The one-shot flush keeps the old frame callback from painting twice.
   Revisit when upstream pipelines distinguish ordinary writes from awaited paints.

